``` CL-07 | Peer Stuck in Decommissioning After offline --enforce-counts
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry CL-07. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH for the duration, CM for the blockers.
    Query: Blockers (CM)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/CL-07-probe.spl,
    probes/CL-07-probe-rest1.spl, probes/CL-07-probe-rest2.spl to confirm the
    data it reads exists here.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/cluster/master/info
| table maintenance_mode rolling_restart_flag
| appendcols
    [| rest splunk_server=local /services/cluster/master/peers
     | stats count(eval(status="Up")) as peers_up
             count(eval(status="Decommissioning")) as peers_decom by site
     | stats list(site) as site list(peers_up) as peers_up
             list(peers_decom) as peers_decom]
